# WUE-isotope-pilot-local data — same convention as the repo-root .gitignore
# (CLAUDE.md Hard Rule #4): raw downloads, extracted archives, and processed
# intermediates are regenerated by code/ and never committed. External
# reference data (tree-ring sources) is likewise regenerated by code/ and
# not committed.
data/raw/
data/extracted/
data/processed/
data/external/

# Download/extract/report logs — kept locally, not git-tracked.
logs/*.log
logs/STATUS
